#!/usr/bin/env node
/**
 * build/ncert-hsec-commerce.mjs — NCERT Business Studies, Accountancy and
 * Economics, Classes XI–XII. All three already exist as subjects (from the NIOS
 * secondary pass, at 14–16) and are extended here to 18. Economics XI–XII runs
 * as four courses: Statistics for Economics and Indian Economic Development in
 * XI, Introductory Microeconomics and Macroeconomics in XII. Descriptions are
 * Marble-authored factual scope summaries (no NCERT text). Idempotent.
 */

